      "reader_note": "Galectin Therapeutics' 2024 and 2025 EPS uses common-stockholder loss after preferred dividends of $153,000 and $138,000, respectively. The filing excludes potential warrant, option, convertible-note and preferred-stock conversions as anti-dilutive during losses. Statement share counts are displayed in thousands with inline scale 3. Full selected share counts and reported USD EPS are retained.",
